        },
        {
          "text": "Ijambo ry’Uhoraho ryaje kuri Zefaniya mwene Kushi, Kushi mwene Gedaliya, Gedaliya mwene Amariya, Amariya mwene Hezekiya, ku ngoma ya Yosiya mwene Amoni, umwami w’i Buyuda.",
