        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo musi n’umusi w’uburake, n’umusi w’ amagorwa n’amarushwa, n’umusi w’ibitongozi n’imisaka, n’umusi w’umwiza n’ubuzinze ināni, n’ umusi w’ibicu n’umwiza w’umuzitanya, ",
